LOAD seg: vaddr=0x0, offset=0x0, filesz=1576, memsz=1576
LOAD seg: vaddr=0x1000, offset=0x1000, filesz=373, memsz=373
LOAD seg: vaddr=0x2000, offset=0x2000, filesz=244, memsz=244
LOAD seg: vaddr=0x3db8, offset=0x2db8, filesz=600, memsz=608
